# Copy to secrets/models.env (git-ignored) for a real model in local dev (todo15 D6); never commit
# or print it. A key already exported in your shell wins over this file.
# Without INKLING_AGENT_MODEL, `pnpm dev` runs the agent's default model when a key is set, and
# `scripted` (free, deterministic) when there's no key at all.
#
# One provider key is enough: the one that matches INKLING_AGENT_MODEL's provider.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# provider:model from the agent's allowlist (INKLING_AGENT_MODEL_ALLOWLIST, apps/agent/src/config.ts):
#   anthropic:claude-sonnet-5-5, anthropic:claude-opus-5-5, openai:gpt-6.1-sol, openai:gpt-6-sol
# INKLING_AGENT_MODEL=anthropic:claude-sonnet-5-5
